{"Name":"Ping","Description":"Test connectivity to the Microsoft 365 Defender with parameters provided at the integration configuration page on the Marketplace tab.","Script":"from ScriptResult import EXECUTION_STATE_COMPLETED, EXECUTION_STATE_FAILED\nfrom SiemplifyAction import SiemplifyAction\nfrom SiemplifyUtils import output_handler\n\nfrom TIPCommon.extraction import extract_configuration_param\n\nfrom constants import (\n    INTEGRATION_NAME,\n    INTEGRATION_DISPLAY_NAME,\n    PING_SCRIPT_NAME,\n    LOGIN_API_ROOT_DEFAULT,\n    GRAPH_API_ROOT_DEFAULT,\n)\nfrom Microsoft365DefenderManager import Microsoft365DefenderManager\n\n\n@output_handler\ndef main():\n    siemplify = SiemplifyAction()\n    siemplify.script_name = PING_SCRIPT_NAME\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Param Init -----------------\")\n\n    login_api_root = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Login API Root\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n        default_value=LOGIN_API_ROOT_DEFAULT,\n        print_value=True,\n    )\n    graph_api_root = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Graph API Root\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n        default_value=GRAPH_API_ROOT_DEFAULT,\n        print_value=True,\n    )\n    api_root = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"API Root\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n        print_value=True,\n    )\n    tenant_id = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Tenant ID\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n        print_value=True,\n    )\n    client_id = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Client ID\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n        print_value=True,\n    )\n    client_secret = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Client Secret\",\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n    verify_ssl = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Verify SSL\",\n        input_type=bool,\n        is_mandatory=True,\n        print_value=True,\n    )\n\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Started -----------------\")\n\n    try:\n        manager = Microsoft365DefenderManager(\n            api_root=api_root,\n            tenant_id=tenant_id,\n            client_id=client_id,\n            client_secret=client_secret,\n            verify_ssl=verify_ssl,\n            microsoft_graph_url=graph_api_root,\n            siemplify=siemplify,\n            login_api_root=login_api_root,\n        )\n        manager.test_connectivity()\n        result = True\n        status = EXECUTION_STATE_COMPLETED\n        output_message = (\n            f\"Successfully connected to the {INTEGRATION_DISPLAY_NAME} server with the provided \"\n            f\"connection parameters!\"\n        )\n\n    except Exception as e:\n        siemplify.LOGGER.error(f\"General error performing action {PING_SCRIPT_NAME}\")\n        siemplify.LOGGER.exception(e)\n        result = False\n        status = EXECUTION_STATE_FAILED\n        output_message = (\n            f\"Failed to connect to the {INTEGRATION_DISPLAY_NAME} server! Error is {e}\"\n        )\n\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Finished -----------------\")\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(f\"Status: {status}\")\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(f\"Result: {result}\")\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(f\"Output Message: {output_message}\")\n\n    siemplify.end(output_message, result, status)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","IntegrationIdentifier":"Microsoft365DefenderBeta","ScriptResultName":"is_success","DynamicResultsMetadata":[],"Creator":"admin","IsEnabled":true,"IsCustom":true,"AiGenerated":false,"IsSystem":false,"Version":0.0,"TimeoutSeconds":600,"IsAsync":null,"AsyncPollingIntervalInSeconds":300,"TotalIntervalTimeoutForAsyncInSeconds":3600,"Parameters":[],"DefaultResultValue":null,"PythonVersion":"None","ActionType":1,"SimulationData":{"Entities":null},"SimulationDataJson":null,"AICategories":[],"OutcomeCategories":[],"AIDescription":"### General Description\nThe **Ping** action is a diagnostic tool designed to verify the connectivity and authentication configuration between Google SecOps and the Microsoft 365 Defender environment. It ensures that the provided credentials are valid and that the SOAR platform can successfully communicate with the Microsoft Graph API.\n\n### Flow Description\n1. **Parameter Extraction:** The action retrieves the connection details and credentials from the integration-level configuration.\n2. **Manager Initialization:** It initializes the `Microsoft365DefenderManager`, which triggers the generation of OAuth2 access tokens for the Microsoft Graph API.\n3. **Connectivity Test:** The action calls the `test_connectivity` method, which performs a lightweight GET request to the Microsoft Graph API's incidents endpoint (`/v1.0/security/incidents`) with a result limit of 1.\n4. **Validation:** If the API returns a successful response, the action completes with a success status. If an error occurs (e.g., authentication failure or network timeout), it catches the exception and reports a failure.\n\n### Additional Notes\n- This action is typically used during the initial setup of the integration or for troubleshooting connection issues.\n- It does not process any entities or modify any data within Microsoft 365 Defender.","AiShortDescription":"Verifies connectivity and authentication configuration between Google SecOps and Microsoft 365 Defender by performing a lightweight API request.","ParametersDescription":"There are no parameters for this action","ImpactAnalysisActionsMetadata":null,"EntityTypes":[]}